GsLastPrism.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: heat is focus; six splayed beams converge into one white-hot lance, and at white heat the impact refracts prism shards
	Capping the gauge never breaks the beam, it only surges mana upkeep
	Right click while channeling to shatter the lance into a prismatic fan, spending all heat
	'''
GsLastPrismHeldProj.DisplayName: Last Prism Lance
GsLastPrismBurstProj.DisplayName: Prismatic Shatter
GsLastPrismShardProj.DisplayName: Prism Shard
GsMagicalHarp.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: unbroken play builds crescendo; at fortissimo the notes swell, race and rain music
	Right click to resolve all crescendo into a ringing chord shockwave; rapid re-hits echo for bonus damage
	'''
GsBubbleGun.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: nonstop spray builds bubble pressure; at a boil the bubbles swell and burst into twin beads on impact
	Cap the gauge and the barrel jams shut in a gush of foam
	Right click to vent everything as a fan of seven great bubbles that pop in a rolling chain
	'''
GsLaserMachinegun.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: heat is spin; the barrel drags cold and roars at white heat, where every sixth shot rides a piercing crimson lance
	Holding the gauge at the redline only surges mana upkeep
	Right click to vent the whole cylinder as a sweeping thirty-round fan
	'''
GsRazorbladeTyphoon.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: each cast banks storm charge; blades born at white heat never get lost, they wheel back to your side and hunt again
	Right click to open the Eye of the Typhoon at your cursor: every blade in the air is drawn into the vortex, and the eye bursts as it closes
	'''
GsMagnetSphere.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: while you hold the staff a feed-tether links you to your sphere, and magnetic flux climbs as long as the link holds
	At full flux the sphere overcharges, lashing heavy arcs at anything close
	Right click to detonate a magnet storm around the sphere that drags lesser foes toward its heart
	'''
GsShadowbeamStaff.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: hold to sustain a shadow beam that ricochets off the walls; white heat adds one more bounce and thickens the beam
	Right click to vent everything as chained shadow bursts along every bend of the beam
	'''
GsChargedBlasterCannon.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: hold to channel; cold plasma spits bolts, white heat pulses focused arc lances
	Charging never stops: cap the gauge and the cannon itself fires the Annihilator, a massive plasma sphere that licks arcs at everything nearby
	Right click to cash out early as a lesser charge shot
	'''
GsLaserMachinegunLanceProj.DisplayName: Crimson Lance
GsShadowbeamStaffHeldProj.DisplayName: Shadow Polyline Beam
GsChargedBlasterCannonHeldProj.DisplayName: Annihilation Charge
GsChargedBlasterCannonOrbProj.DisplayName: Annihilator
GsMagicalHarpNovaProj.DisplayName: Chord Shockwave
